  "analysis": "I have identified the pcaps: `train_neg.pcap` and `train_pos.pcap`. I also see `local.rules` and `suricata.yaml` in `/root/`. Now I will examine the contents of the positive pcap to understand the data format better.",
  "plan": "I will use `strings` on `train_pos.pcap` to see the HTTP requests and confirm the pattern described in the task.",
  "commands": [
    {
      "keystrokes": "strings /root/pcaps/train_pos.pcap | head -n 50\n",
      "duration": 0.5
    }
